\title{RegiStat: offline bilingual data capture and reproducible analysis}
\description{
RegiStat is a free, open-source toolkit for clinical and laboratory
researchers. The current development version provides a metadata-driven
data dictionary (Spanish and English), a data validation engine and a
seeded generator of synthetic registry data for testing and demonstration.
}
\section{Privacy}{

RegiStat never needs an internet connection. The synthetic data it
generates carry the identifier prefix \verb{SYN-} and contain no information
about real people. Never commit real patient data to a public repository.
}

